# Design sequences - withheld until each submission window closes.
# Matched by PATTERN, not by name: the list below once named each file
# individually, and a newly created third file (round2_sequences.csv) was
# therefore not covered and got committed.
#
# The same mistake nearly repeated on 24 Oct: "submission/challenge2_*" named a
# single challenge, so the first challenge 3 file written was not covered. Any
# future challenge is matched now, whatever it is numbered.
tnf/results/*sequences*.csv
submission/challenge*
glp1r/results/*sequences*.csv
data/glp1r/
incoming/
